~ start
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoNotOkay")
Aurinko: And so I fell.... Or jumped
Aurinko: I thought I was dead but I... I was revived...?
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoMeh")
Aurinko: Not like I give a damn about it.
Aurinko: Kuutamo is stuck there. On top of a tower, a cage desinged to imprison me.
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoNormal")
Aurinko: It need someone there, someone filled with hatred.
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoTraumatized")
Aurinko: It... feed on me... Or at least it used to untill Kuutamo, the Beloved Hero, ruined everything!
Aurinko: ...The tower needs to feast on.
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoNotOkay")
Aurinko: ...
Aurinko: Poor Kuutamo...
Aurinko: Her soul...
Aurinko: So much hate has to be really overwhelming...
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoMeh")
Aurinko: ...
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoNormal")
Aurinko: I have to save her.
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "AurinkoHappi")
Aurinko: I have to bounce back.
do SceneManager.emit_signal("animation", "None")
=> END